<title>JAPAN: Tokyo January dept store sales down 1.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Tokyo January dept store sales down 1.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales at department stores in the Tokyo area fell 1.7 percent in January from a year earlier to 188.2 billion yen, the Japan Department Stores' Association announced on Friday.  </p>
<p>Sales fell for the third successive month in January year on year, although the scale of the decline was smaller a statement.</p>
<p>Sales of clothes remained sluggish. The sales fell 1.9 percent in January year on year due to unusually warm weather, the industry body added.</p>
</text>
